[Oo]ut/
[Dd]ebug/
[Rr]elease/
[Dd]ebugPublic/
[Rr]eleasePublic/
x64/
x86/
[Aa][Rr][Mm]/
[Aa][Rr][Mm]64/
build/
bld/
